      "raw_text": "WL modular de- WL via a core language WL and a prototype extraction 17 2 10 24 33 §2 modularity automation com- Traditional on-paper cryptographic 7 23 25 59 P composed with Q is gen- P and Q separately. On the other hand, tools that do support 11 31 57 not designed with assuming that the Ideally, cryptographic protocols 10 symbolic attackers [ 15 18 19 53 51 63 We introduce O WL assume secure implementations of lower-level spec- WL are verified in the computational model, arbitrary polynomial- reduction from the pro-",
